@baseUrl = https://your-app.test
@token = your-bearer-token

### Mark Single Message Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark Single Message Unread
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/1/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark All Messages Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark All Read (filter by source)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/read-all?source=contact_form_section
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archive Single Message
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/1/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unarchive Single Message (restore to inbox)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/1/unarchive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft Delete Single Message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
